//! A read-only SQLite file reader in Windjammer: database header, `sqlite_master`, table b-trees (interior and leaf
//! pages, overflow chains) and the record format. It reads the bytes of a database file, so there is no SQLite engine,
//! no SQL and no native library; use `std::db` to run queries and write data, and this to inspect or export a file
//! (CI artefacts, backups, test fixtures). Rows of a table come back in rowid order.
pub mod format
pub mod database
